  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "First release, wrapping three.js r185. A typed C# scene graph generated from @types/three, with batched interop: a frame costs one call however many properties it changed, which is what makes it usable over a Blazor Server circuit. Includes glTF loading with the animation clips a file brings along, optional DRACO and KTX2 decoding, OrbitControls, pointer picking, and TSL shading on the WebGPU renderer. The three.js bundle ships with the package - no npm, no CDN, no script tags.",
